### **Phase 2: Create Data Adapters (Week 1)**

**Goal:** Transform copilot data + MOAT docs into educational structure

**Adapters to Create:**
1. `capability-narrative-adapter.ts` - Extract narrative from MOAT docs
2. `capability-educational-adapter.ts` - Transform copilot data to educational format
3. `capability-example-adapter.ts` - Extract examples from MOAT docs

**Location:** `src/data/adapters/capabilities/`

**Example:**
```typescript
// src/data/adapters/capabilities/toxicity-educational-adapter.ts
export const transformToxicityToEducational = (
  toxicityData: CoPilotDetailContent,
  moatDoc: MOATDocument
): EducationalCapabilityPage => {
  return {
    hero: {
      question: moatDoc.heroQuestion,
      genericAnswer: moatDoc.genericAnswer,
      ourAnswer: moatDoc.ourAnswer,
    },
    problem: {
      title: moatDoc.problemTitle,
      narrative: moatDoc.problemNarrative,
      painPoints: toxicityData.coreProblemPoints.map(...),
    },
    solution: {
      title: moatDoc.solutionTitle,
      narrative: moatDoc.solutionNarrative,
      keyFeatures: toxicityData.keyCapabilities.map(...),
    },
    // ... etc
  };
};
```

